  "summary": "两个非递增数组中找 i<=j 且 nums1[i]<=nums2[j] 的下标对，最大化 j-i。",
  "insight": "双指针保持 j 不回退。条件满足时增大 j 争取更远距离；不满足时只能增大 i 降低 nums1[i]，并确保 j>=i。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "两数组都非递增",
    "有效对要求 i<=j",
    "指针 j 单调前进"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "monotone-two-pointers",
      "title": "非递增数组双指针",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "利用值与下标条件的单调性线性扫描。",
      "steps": [
        "i=j=answer=0",
        "while i<n1 且 j<n2，先令 j=max(j,i)",
        "nums1[i]<=nums2[j] 时更新 j-i 并 j++，否则 i++，返回"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n+m)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/monotone-two-pointers/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/monotone-two-pointers/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/monotone-two-pointers/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
